      "kind": "curriculum_or_design_reference",
      "body": "- Every source book and edition inventoried.\n- Every chapter and major section accounted for.\n- Maps, tables, captions, exercises and practical activities checked rather than ignored.\n- Duplicates and edition differences explicitly recorded.",
      "status": "reference_only",
