      "line_end": 1327,
      "kind": "curriculum_or_design_reference",
      "body": "- Explains each major concept at multiple depths.\n- Uses diagnostic questions and can identify plausible misconceptions.\n- Can move among text, map, diagram, graph and numerical data.\n- Tests independent recall and transfer.\n- Provides accessible explanations without losing scientific accuracy.",
