      "kind": "curriculum_or_design_reference",
      "body": "- Maps content to the current official syllabus.\n- Produces structured answers with mechanisms, Indian/world examples and limitations.\n- Handles data and maps correctly.\n- Separates General Studies depth from Geography optional depth.\n- Does not fabricate previous-year trends or current statistics.",
      "status": "reference_only",
