      "body": "This file is **not yet proof that every word, diagram, table, exercise or caption in every uploaded PDF has been individually audited**. That claim requires a separate source ledger and chapter-by-chapter QA. Specifically:\n\n1. confirm exact edition/year and rationalisation status of each source;\n2. build a chapter-and-section ledger for every book;\n3. compare extraction with page images for tables, maps, figures, captions and sidebars;\n4. map every chapter objective and exercise to one or more structured concepts;\n5. verify factual claims and correct OCR/extraction artefacts;\n6. review with subject experts, especially advanced climatology, geomorphology, human geography and GIS;\n7. add current official UPSC syllabus mapping and dated previous-year-question tags;\n8. run misconception and transfer tests against the actual Techgram teacher.\n\n**No false completion claim:** a long master file is a strong foundation, not a substitute for source-by-source coverage verification.",
